<title>USA: Modern Controls sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Modern Controls sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Modern Controls Inc said Wednesday its board of directors declared a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The split is payable in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend on September 12, to shareholders of record on August 22.</p>
<p>Modern Controls makes and markets high-technology instrumentation to test packages and packaging materials, films and pharmaceutical products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
